X:1
T:Aamra Sobai Raaja
C:Rabindranath Tagore
S:notes: data/raw_data/midi/rs000309.mid (Geetabitan, arranged by Anjan Ganguly), violin track
S:lyrics: data/raw_data/text/lyrics/rs000309.txt (Geetabitan transliteration)
S:alignment: data/raw_data/swaralipi/rs000309.pdf (Geetabitan swaralipi)
N:Notes quantized to 16ths, pitch bends applied (scripts/midi_to_ktab.py read_tracks). Sa = C; the sanchari has tivra Ma (F#), the rest is in C major.
N:Form played by the MIDI: sthayi; antara (its first line twice) and the refrain "Noile moder ... Aamra sabai raaja"; sthayi again; sanchari and refrain; abhog (its first line twice) and refrain; sthayi to end.
N:The swaralipi's half-bar "-1 -1 -1" before the antara and before the sanchari (a held note in place of the return "Aamra") is not played by the MIDI; it goes straight on.
N:Syllables placed on the notes as in the swaralipi; one swaralipi matra = one quarter note, one half-bar of 3 matras = one 3/4 bar.
